  "claude_instructions": [
    "Read this file as a data reference for Day 1 and Day 2 end-of-day boss encounters.",
    "Keep each id unchanged when using it as a key in generated config or code.",
    "Use name_en and members_en for matching against game/mod data; use name_pt only for user-facing Portuguese labels.",
    "Do not assume a boss display name or this dataset id is the internal ID used by the game.",
    "Inspect the user's existing project, mod framework, and configuration format before implementing changes.",
    "If internal IDs cannot be verified from project files or reliable sources, flag them as unresolved instead of inventing them.",
    "Do not add Day 3 Nightlords or ordinary field bosses to this list unless explicitly requested."
  ],
